al","due":"2026-06-09","description":"ID verification procedure","notes":null},{"title":"Account closure procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Account closure procedure upon the operator becoming aware that the player is a minor post-registration.","notes":null},{"title":"Record-keeping","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Record-keeping","notes":null},{"title":"Contacting the operator","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Procedure on how the player can contact the operator regarding RG concerns via email or chat","notes":null},{"title":"Language","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":null},{"title":"Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":null},{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":null},{"title":"Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":null},{"title":"Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":null},{"title":"Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":null},{"title":"Identification of vulnerable persons","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Procedu